Back from the Domination gameplay options page calls the authored presentation
function TransitionGrudgeMatchToMainMenu. Its first host calls are service 27
for "homemodel" and "awaymodel": original FEModelManager::GetModel, then
DestroyModel only when that captain hologram exists. The holograms are created
by StartHomeAwayCaptainHologramSequence, which only the Choose Sides handler
calls, so on the captain/sidekick route the original lookup finds nothing.

Move only case 27 under the existing Domination admission. FEModelManager is
the whole original unit, created by original BeginLoadFEWorld. Service 26 and
every other model, impostor, trophy and animation service keep their guards.

